  "validationCorrections": [
    "Never-returning helper narrowing and verified generic DTO associations were corrected without loosening payload checks. Private diagnostics used during publication diagnosis were removed.",
    "Shutdown retirement uses the still-owned profile lock after new work is fenced. Production deletion consults the actual attachment owner before accepted task namespace removal.",
    "JSON syntax edits order coincident insertions correctly; trailing comma stripping never alters comma/brace text inside quoted values. Credential roundtrip tests assert the exact retained values.",
    "Environment reference discovery uses an independent regex rather than inheriting shared lastIndex; alias source grants are exercised before resolution and contact.",
    "Stale logical MCP fingerprints and normalized reserved upsert names reject before their respective effects. Unknown-section edits preceding admission retain the existing logical-fingerprint semantics while file publication still checks exact fresh bytes.",
    "Full-suite fixed-port failures were corrected with real isolated listener fixtures and captured finite host port selection; production redirect defaults remain unchanged.",
    "Checks run while final source edits were being integrated were retained for diagnosis and excluded from final acceptance. The final full app/standalone, private Node and focused suites ran against the unchanged frozen sources."
