    "#202/#208/#213/#217 full retained/native parity, installed/historical cutover, live providers and source effects, signed production deployment and Electron retirement remain open.",
    "Cached Claude Code/Codex adapters have no reviewed refresh acknowledgement; mutation is unavailable in that state. Cold adapters can apply before startup. Windows cmd/bat probes remain unavailable.",
